  "visualBrief": "Complete principal Christiansborg Palace exterior and exact-way connected riding complex: high asymmetric U, central through-passage/tower, both returned wings/lower risalits, attached low links, complete curved stables/inner arcades and twin riding halls, pitched roofs/dormers/chimneys, recessed white-grid glazing/closed arcade backs and original simplified trim. Tower has a stone base,real open lower arched gallery,curved metal shoulders,open upper lantern,small gold accents andthree original green crown/finial silhouettes. Main court/riding grounds remain open; separate chapel432/437,archive-side gallery516,city andcanals remain native. No copied figures,heraldry,text orinteriors.",
