    "heightBasis": "Approximate9m standard global DEM reference,main-palace floor11.8m andlow riding-ground floor6.7m. Main eaves28.8m/roof38.6m,low arcades7.7m/roof13.5m,twin halls25.3m andtower105.3m are map/picture-guided heights above that approximate datum. Low facade bases follow a bounded graded plinth between high court andlow riding precinct while roof levels remain fixed. Three small supported approaches use actual standard terrain profiles; the portal floor andlarge open precinct stay native. No surveyed historic elevations orflattened precinct is claimed."
